WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:06.080
Now we can only trust them.

00:09.560 --> 00:14.040
Your Highness the western neighbor seems to be moving how can Your Highness suppress this news.

00:14.120 --> 00:19.400
And not let His Majesty recall troops to defend Minister Xue Father has planned this battle for half his life.

00:19.480 --> 00:23.720
You have no solid evidence how can I issue such an order?

00:23.800 --> 00:27.400
We're not afraid of the unlikely but the one in ten thousand, Your Highness.

00:27.480 --> 00:31.947
If we wait for solid evidence before sending troops wouldn't it be too late?

00:32.800 --> 00:38.227
Your Highness is considerate of the Emperor but now the country's defenses are empty if the enemy truly invades.

00:38.320 --> 00:42.267
And we suffer defeat will His Majesty be considerate of Your Highness?

00:44.040 --> 00:49.960
There were heavy rains in the southern border which reduced your embezzlement by a bit so you can't do this job anymore?

00:50.040 --> 00:54.240
Minister Xue, do you think I'm young and easy to bully and know nothing?

00:55.280 --> 00:58.600
Your Highness, everything I do is for Great Xuan.

00:59.080 --> 01:04.520
Your servant is willing to remonstrate with death Minister Xue, you mustn't Your Highness.

01:04.600 --> 01:07.600
We cannot treat Great Xuan's fate as a game.

01:24.560 --> 01:26.200
Lady Chen, what brings you here?

01:26.280 --> 01:29.720
Since Minister Xue wants to remonstrate with death go help him.

01:29.800 --> 01:31.200
Yes.

01:38.720 --> 01:44.280
Chen Wan'er you you you dare kill a senior minister in the Taiji Hall.

01:44.360 --> 01:47.693
Do you really think His Majesty will tolerate you later?

01:50.400 --> 01:51.800
Whether he tolerates me.

01:52.560 --> 01:56.720
Is a matter between His Majesty and me as husband and wife you're old.

01:57.880 --> 01:59.240
Still so nosy.

02:12.400 --> 02:16.560
The Crown Prince is overseeing the court His Majesty is personally leading the campaign.

02:16.640 --> 02:21.440
My son has the courage to fight on the front lines the Chen family is not panicking.

02:21.520 --> 02:24.427
Gentlemen what are you panicking about?

02:26.360 --> 02:30.307
The decisive battle between Great Xuan and Wuzhao is in these few days.

02:30.760 --> 02:33.840
You gentlemen shall stay in the palace as guests.

02:34.480 --> 02:37.040
I will personally host you.

02:39.800 --> 02:41.467
Before the battle is settled.

02:42.320 --> 02:44.160
Anyone who passes through this gate.

02:44.240 --> 02:45.640
Kill.

02:45.800 --> 02:47.800
Those who speak cunningly of retreat.

02:47.880 --> 02:48.800
Kill.

02:48.880 --> 02:50.560
Those who harm the state for personal gain.

02:50.640 --> 02:52.040
Kill.

02:53.960 --> 02:55.320
Yes.

03:06.240 --> 03:10.720
Raise my royal banner in the formation send all the imperial guard today.

03:10.800 --> 03:12.800
We must not let him escape.

03:13.040 --> 03:14.440
Yes.

03:21.800 --> 03:24.640
Imperial Guard follow me and kill.

03:25.480 --> 03:30.080
Kill.

03:46.480 --> 03:50.960
Sikong Yao today is the life-and-death battle between you and me.

03:51.080 --> 03:52.480
Report.

03:53.040 --> 03:58.200
My King something's wrong Xuan troops are attacking from behind cutting off our retreat what?

04:04.480 --> 04:06.813
Follow me to cut off their retreat.

04:48.280 --> 04:53.747
Brother let's retreat I fell into an ambush.

04:54.000 --> 04:56.333
This time, I fell into an ambush.

04:57.120 --> 04:58.520
Let's regroup.

05:00.800 --> 05:03.800
Brother brother.

05:05.240 --> 05:09.640
Brother if not for you, for your son not following my orders.

05:09.720 --> 05:13.920
And engaging the enemy on your own how could we have come to this today?

05:14.000 --> 05:18.240
Brother don't my empire was destroyed by you.

05:18.760 --> 05:20.160
Brother.

05:22.720 --> 05:25.440
Recall the vanguard break through from the rear.

05:25.520 --> 05:26.480
Yes.

